docs {
  # GET /api/vehicles/ — List vehicles

  Returns paginated vehicles. Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `travels/views.py:23 VehicleViewSet` + `VehicleSerializer` (`travels/serializers.py:20`, fields `id,name,passengers`).

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing/invalid token (see `_auth/get_unauthenticated.bru`)

  ## Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "count": 3,
    "next": null,
    "previous": null,
    "results": [
      { "id": 1, "name": "Luxury SUV", "passengers": 4 },
      { "id": 2, "name": "Executive Van", "passengers": 8 },
      { "id": 3, "name": "Sprinter", "passengers": 10 }
    ]
  }
  ```

  Envelope `{count, next, previous, results}` per `core/pagination.py:4`.

  ## Error (401)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
